  <div class="takeaways">
    <h2>Key Takeaways</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>ZipRecruiter reported an average annual pay of $92,813 for sport psychologists in the United States in October 2026, with a typical range of $66,500 to $117,000 (the 25th to 75th percentile).</li>
      <li>Top earners at the 90th percentile make $146,000 and above, according to the same source.</li>
